{"title":"VGOD E-Liquid","description":"\u003cp\u003eShop one of the best freebase e-liquids at best price in Kenya now. If you're here, you must know how smooth and amazing these e liquids are! Premium quality and perfect taste, simply VGOD is famous for.\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-iced-mango-bomb","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Iced Mango Bomb","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"iced mango bomb logo\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0683\/3504\/2878\/files\/iced-mangobomb-logo.png?v=1685910549\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMango Bomb Iced is a harmoniously balanced flavor that transports you directly to soft ripened yellow slices of a freshly peeled juicy mangoes with a frosty mentholated finish. The primary note of the mango fruit is delicately sweet and silky throughout the inhale straight through to the chilly exhale. It is an outright smooth mango menthol blast that offers maximum satisfaction in 0mg, 3mg, 6mg, 12mg, or 18mg nicotine strengths.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBrand: \u003c\/strong\u003eVGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: ICED BERRY BOMB E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine Type:\u003c\/strong\u003e Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670488883255,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 3mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670488916023,"sku":"VGOD - Mango Bomb - 6mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","o