our taste buds all day long in 0mg, 3mg, 6mg, 12mg, or 18mg nicotine strengths!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: ICED APPLE BOMB E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670489473079,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 3mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670489505847,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 6mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670489538615,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 12mg iced","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"3 mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670489571383,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 3mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6 mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670489604151,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 6mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"12 mg (Without Ice)","offer_id":41670489636919,"sku":"VGOD - Apple Bomb - 12mg without ice","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod-iced-apple-bomb-eliquid.jpg?v=1756300732"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-lush-ice","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Lush Ice","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" itemprop=\"description\"\u003eLush Ice is VGOD's signature watermelon candy flavor infused with a fresh breeze of menthol. Upon exhale a mixture of melon flavors infiltrate your taste buds that provides a smooth, cool and fruity all-day vaping experience!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Lush Ice E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670489669687,"sku":"VGOD - Lush Ice - 3mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670489702455,"sku":"VGOD - Lush Ice - 6mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670489735223,"sku":"VGOD - Lush Ice - 12mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod_lushice_3mg_e_juice.webp?v=1756170494"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-cubano-silver","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Cubano Silver","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\"\u003eUnder the buttery bright vanilla summer moon on the creamy coast of Santa Maria del Mar, you’re watching the warm waves roll in. With sweet sounds of rumba in the distance, you reach for your mod to relish in the rarity of a truly classic full flavored Cuban cigar infused with a warm top note of buttery vanilla custard, rounded off with a hint of spice, sweet caramelized brown sugar and honey for the finish. In a flash, you take another deep pull and instantly you’re ready for whatever the night brings. Cubano Silver, you chillin’ yet?\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\" title=\"Vape e liquids\"\u003eE-Liquid\u003c\/a\u003e Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Cubano Silver E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670489767991,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Silver - 3mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670489800759,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Silver - 6mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670489833527,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano Silver - 12mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod_cubano-silver-eliquid.jpg?v=1756300731"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-cubano","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Cubano","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"product attribute overview\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"value\" itemprop=\"description\"\u003eVGOD's Cubano is a full flavor Cuban cigar topped off with a drizzle of soft creamy vanilla undertones. Richly robust Cuban tobacco with such a smooth finish, the Cubano is an instant classic that you will want on hand all throughout your day.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Cubano E Liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 60mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Freebase E liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 6mg \/ 12mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"3mg","offer_id":41670489866295,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano - 3mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"6mg","offer_id":41670489899063,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano - 6mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"12mg","offer_id":41670489931831,"sku":"VGOD - Cubano - 12mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/vgod_cubano_3mg_eliquid.jpg?v=1756300732"},{"product_id":"vgod-e-liquid-cubano-black","title":"VGOD E Liquid - Cubano Black","description":"\u003cp\u003eCubano Black is a crafted specialty and has been aged to perfection. It is handcrafted in limited quantities and pre-steeped for months to coalesce to perfection. BOLD is the word you will envision when the robust Cuban cigar flavor hits your palate commingling perfectly with hints of rich creamy custard. The only thing that you will be thinking of as you exhale this smooth, well-balanced flavor, is the anticipation of your next draw of Cubano Black by VGOD.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eE-Liquid Detail